{"schemaVersion":2,"id":"meetdeet-2014-deet-science2-08","exam":"MEET_DEET","year":2014,"subject":"chemistry","number":8,"points":2,"unitId":"thermo","unitLabel":"열역학·열화학","topic":"엔탈피·자유에너지·열역학","classificationStatus":"keyword-candidate-unverified","classificationCandidates":["thermo","solid"],"stem":"다음은 이온성 고체 MX의 수용액 형성에 대한 열역학 함수 중, \n격자 엔탈피(ΔH격자), 수화 엔탈피(ΔH수화), 용해 엔탈피(ΔH용해), 용해\n자유 에너지(ΔG용해)에 해당하는 반응식이다.\nMX(s)→M +(g)+X −(g)\nΔH격자\nM +(g)+X −(g)→M +(aq)+X −(aq)\nΔH수화\nMX(s)→M +(aq)+X −(aq)\nΔH용해, ΔG용해\n표는 25℃에서 암염(rock salt) 구조를 갖는 고체에 대한 󰠾ΔH격자󰠾, \n󰠾ΔH수화󰠾, ΔH용해, ΔG용해를 나타낸 것이다.\n(단위: kJ/mol)\n󰠾ΔH격자󰠾\n󰠾ΔH수화󰠾\nΔH용해\nΔG용해\nNaCl\n(가)\n784\n+3.9\n−\nNaF\n929\n(나)\n+1.9\n+7.9\nLiCl\n861\n898\n(다)\n−\n이에 대한 설명으로 옳은 것은? ","stemTextItemIds":["t001","t002","t003","t004","t005","t006","t007","t008","t009","t010","t011","t012","t013","t014","t015","t016","t017","t018","t019","t020","t021","t022","t023","t024","t025","t026","t027","t028","t029","t030","t031","t032"],"stemAssetIds":["fig-01","fig-02","fig-03","fig-04","fig-05","fig-06","fig-07","fig-08","fig-09"],"options":[{"number":1,"text":"(가) > 861이다.","assetIds":[],"textItemIds":["t033"]},{"number":2,"text":"(나) < 784이다.","assetIds":[],"textItemIds":["t034"]},{"number":3,"text":"(다) > 0이다.","assetIds":[],"textItemIds":["t035"]},{"number":4,"text":"NaCl이 물에 용해될 때 열이 방출된다.","assetIds":[],"textItemIds":["t036"]},{"number":5,"text":"NaF가 물에 용해될 때 엔트로피가 감소한다.","assetIds":[],"textItemIds":["t037"]}],"answer":5,"acceptedAnswers":[5],"answerStatus":"source-text","assets":[{"id":"fig-01","width":505,"height":24,"region":0,"bbox":[72.3,24.715,202.0,9.6],"role":"stem","overlayTextItemIds":["t002"],"src":"/mdeet/assets/meetdeet-2014-deet-science2-08/01.webp"},{"id":"fig-02","width":25,"height":24,"region":0,"bbox":[71.5,43.115,10.0,9.6],"role":"stem","overlayTextItemIds":[],"src":"/mdeet/assets/meetdeet-2014-deet-science2-08/02.webp"},{"id":"fig-03","width":776,"height":183,"region":0,"bbox":[14.7,65.515,310.4,73.2],"role":"stem",